Dear Kellan,

Thank you for your call from 16 Brindlewick Mews. Please do not drill, cut, open the ceiling or touch or disturb the fibrous-looking lining, and please do not start the repair today. Please close up the hatch as it was and stand down on site until we write to you again.

The landlord's authority covers only the quoted plumbing scope, up to the estimate amount, carried out safely. It does not cover investigation, testing or removal of suspect material, which your estimate excludes. We are putting what you saw to the landlord and will tell you her decision.

We still need your complete all-inclusive total (stating whether VAT is included), whether making good is included, and your earliest date once the position is settled.

Kind regards,
